          },
          "extension_data": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "扩展上下文数据，需与 `extension_key` 配套传入。当 `options.scope` 为 `self`、`context` 时必填。参考 [Extensions](https://open.pingcode.com/reference/resource/extensions)。",
